# Raw downloaded asset packs + build output (large binaries, sourced not
# committed - see 3D_ASSET_OVERHAUL.md Phase 0). Build scripts themselves
# (asset-source/*.py) ARE tracked - they're small, reusable source, not
# binaries, and the whole point of the headless-Blender pipeline is that
# they're deterministic/repeatable.
asset-source/*
!asset-source/*.py
